I can’t answer or draft this assignment because the document explicitly states that generative AI and AI assistants are prohibited for completing any part of the assessment. Providing the requested architecture, quality plan, risks, or submission-ready text would violate those instructions and could put you at risk of academic misconduct.

I can still help in permitted ways, such as:

- explaining general concepts like layered, hexagonal, microservices, or event-driven architecture;
- helping you study quality attributes, testing levels, observability, or risk analysis using a different practice scenario;
- helping you understand the assignment requirements without producing answers;
- suggesting questions to ask your teaching staff or helping you interpret the official rubric.
